 to your existing AKS clusters and supports multi-environment scenarios across dev, test, staging, and production, including Azure hybrid and edge deployments.","name":"AKS desktop","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Azure/aks-desktop","publisher":"Microsoft","publisherUrl":"https://www.microsoft.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Azure/aks-desktop/releases/tag/v0.9.1","tags":["aks","azure","azure-kubernetes-service","cluster","cluster-management","dashboard","k8s","kubernetes"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) 桌面应用程序。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Kubernetes 工作流通常需要编写和维护 YAML，切换不同的工具（如 kubectl、仪表板、监控工具），并理解底层基础设施概念。\nAKS 桌面版通过“项目”简化了这一过程，“项目”将应用程序所需的一切整合为一个可管理的单元，并提供引导式工作流，用于部署、监控、扩展和排查应用程序问题。\nAKS 桌面版可在您现有的环境和工具中运行，包括 Visual Studio Code、GitHub 和 CI/CD 管道。它能够连接到您现有的 AKS 集群，并支持跨开发、测试、预发布和生产环境的多环境场景，包括 Azure 混合云和边缘部署。","tags":["aks","azure","azure-kubernetes-service","k8s","kubernetes","仪表板","集群","集群管理"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.microsoft.com/","releaseDate":"2026-07-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Azure/aks-desktop/releases/tag/v0.9.1","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/AKSdesktop/0.43.0/Microsoft.AKSdesktop.yaml","sha256":"c99f245cb44b8436b905a9564ff54859d25b638e17f50a2d31bba5d6d3f32141"},{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/AKSdesktop/0.43.0/Microsoft.AKSdesktop.installer.yaml","sha256":"3edb9134eeaebba2c7b62a7e60b7f9982b4e06fdd62d64146ac0e1c39a508cc0"},{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/AKSdesktop/0.43.0/Microsoft.AKSdesktop.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"da43efe3303ef7af50ec865846a74ff568321ee4d5e6090eb976b4dd422c419d"},{"path":"manifests/m/Microsoft/AKSdesktop/0.43.0/Microsoft.AKSdesktop.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"2b94ef616a4b1b1ef6612bbd41a120d1dfe74c93cb8c9b0b86544e5858a77ef3"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.43.0"}